turn of resources."},"12580477":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Simple full opposing monster clear."},"13935001":{"role":"GY extender","quick":"In your Main Phase, banish it from GY as cost; on resolution, send a card from hand to GY, then summon a Lunalight from Deck if you sent a card. Its face-up trap effect can give the opponent a token after a Fusion Summon."},"14152693":{"role":"Cycle","quick":"On Normal or Special Summon, send a Lunalight card from hand to GY to draw one; its own send-by-effect trigger can revive a small Lunalight with effects negated."},"14532163":{"role":"Spell","quick":"Clears opposing backrow or Attack Position monsters while you control no face-up cards.","caution":"Use it before establishing face-up Mikanko or Equip Spells."},"14558127":{"role":"Hand trap","quick":"Discards itself to negate an effect that adds from Deck, summons from Deck, or sends from Deck."},"15693423":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Best from an empty field at the end of the Battle Phase."},"16259549":{"role":"LIGHT · Rank 3 · ATK 400","quick":"An unlocked Rank 3 that can survive battle by detaching. Its battle opens the Zeus route.","caution":"It does not reflect battle damage. Have enough LP to survive and a material to prevent destruction; two different players being unable to target it does not make it invulnerable."},"17217034":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Negates a 2500+ ATK monster on summon and can clear monsters after attacking when Raye and Roze are in GY."},"17751597":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"When a Spell/Trap Card, or monster effect, is activated that includes an effect that Special Summons a monster(s): Return to the Extra Deck, 1 face-up Fusion Monster you control, or 2 Fusion Monsters in your GY, that mention \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material, and if you do, negate the activation, and if you do that, destroy that card. You can banish this card from your GY, then target 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap in your GY, except \"Branded Retribution\"; add it to your hand. You can only use 1 \"Branded Retribution\" effect per turn, and only once that turn."},"18144506":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Simple opposing Spell/Trap clear."},"18144507":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Destroy all Spell and Trap Cards your opponent controls."},"18377261":{"role":"FIRE · Level 3 · ATK 0","quick":"An equipped Ha-Re searches a Mikanko Equip Spell. A good Arabesque / Fire Dance extender.","caution":"A monster that is merely summoned without becoming equipped does not trigger her search. Double-Edged Sword is not a Mikanko Equip Spell, so Ha-Re cannot search it."},"19096726":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"When your opponent activates a monster effect, while you control a Fusion Monster that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" as material (Quick Effect): You can send this card from your hand or face-up field to the GY; negate that effect. If this card is banished: You can add from your Deck to your hand, 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\", or 1 monster that mentions it, except \"Tri-Brigade Mercourier\". You can only use each effect of \"Tri-Brigade Mercourier\" once per turn."},"19304410":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"If you control a \"Tri-Brigade\" or \"Springans\" monster, except \"Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt\": You can Special Summon this card from your hand. If this card is sent to the GY: You can Special Summon 1 of the following monsters from your GY in Defense Position, except \"Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt\".\r\n● \"Tri-Brigade\" monster ● \"Springans\" monster\r\n● \"Fallen of Albaz\" or 1 monster that mentions it\r\nYou can only use each effect of \"Tri-Brigade Springans Kitt\" once per turn."},"24010609":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Targets another controlled card at activation, sends it during resolution, then shields later Spell activations from responses. In the End Phase it Sets different Striker Spell names based on activations while face-up."},"24094653":{"role":"Fusion","quick":"Fuse with monsters in hand/field. It is recyclable through Masquerade and Kaleido Chick."},"24224830":{"role":"Protection","quick":"Target one monster in the opponent’s GY, banish it and negate the corresponding effects through the end of the next turn. Limited to one."},"24299458":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Sends cards as cost. Chained Quick-Plays can become efficient payment."},"24550676":{"role":"Panther Dancer + 2 Lunalights; protects itself from opposing targeting and opposing destruction, attacks twice.","quick":"12320"},"24915933":{"role":"Extra Deck tool","quick":"\"Blazing Cartesia, the Virtuous\" + 1 LIGHT or DARK monster\r\nIf this card is Fusion Summoned: You can send 1 Level 6 or higher LIGHT or DARK monster from your Deck or Extra Deck to the GY. If a monster is Special Summoned by your opponent's activated monster effect (except during the Damage Step): You can banish this card from your field or GY; Special Summon 1 \"Dogmatika\" monster from your Deck or 1 \"Despia\" monster from your Extra Deck. You can only use each effect of \"Granguignol the Dusk Dragon\" once per turn."},"25072579":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Rewrites an opponent's 2000+ ATK monster effect into destroying one of your Ace Links."},"25311006":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Becomes live after an opponent's monster effect in your Main Phase."},"25451383":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"This card's name becomes \"Fallen of Albaz\" while on the field or in the GY. If this card is in your hand or GY: You can send 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\" or 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap from your hand or Deck to the GY; apply the following effect based on where you sent it from.\r\n● Hand: Special Summon this card.\r\n● Deck: Place this card on the bottom of the Deck, then, if you placed this card from your hand, draw 1 card.\r\nYou can only use this effect of \"Albion the Shrouded Dragon\" once per turn."},"26077387":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Quick Effect Tributes herself to deploy a Sky Striker Ace to the Extra Monster Zone."},"29301450":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Generic interaction, but unavailable after Linkage resolves because it is not a Sky Striker Ace."},"29948294":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"Reveal 1 monster in your hand and send 1 Level 8 Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck to the GY with the same Type that has 2500 ATK or DEF, then you can apply this effect.\r\n● Discard the revealed monster, and if you do, add 1 \"Fallen of Albaz\", or 1 monster that mentions it, from your Deck to your hand.\r\nDuring the End Phase, if a Fusion Monster was sent to your GY this turn: You can add this card from the GY to your hand. You can only use 1 \"Branded in High Spirits\" effect per turn, and only once that turn."},"30271097":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"(This card is always treated as a \"Branded\" and \"Dogmatika\" card.)\r\nActivate 1 of these effects;\r\n● Send 1 monster that mentions \"Fallen of Albaz\" from your Extra Deck to the GY, then target 1 face-up card on the field; destroy it.\r\n● If you have an \"Ecclesia\" monster in your field or GY: Target 1 monster in either GY; Special Summon it to your field.\r\nYou can only activate 1 \"The Fallen & The Virtuous\" per turn."},"32807846":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Finds Raye or Roze. Limited to one in this profile."},"33854624":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"You can target 1 LIGHT or DARK monster in either GY; banish it, and if you do, Special Summon this card from your hand. This is a Quick Effect if your opponent controls a monster. If this card is Special Summoned: You can activate this effect; during the End Phase of this turn, add 1 Dragon monster from your Deck or GY to your hand, except \"Bystial Magnamhut\". You can only use each effect of \"Bystial Magnamhut\" once per turn."},"34433770":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Recycles equal numbers of Aces and Striker Spells; every 3 returned cards earns one bounce."},"35261759":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Banishes 10 face-down as cost, then draws 2. Check what is already 