; banish it, and if you do, Special Summon this card from your hand. This is a Quick Effect if your opponent controls a monster. If this card is sent to the GY: You can send 1 \"Bystial\" monster or 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap from your Deck to the GY, except \"Bystial Saronir\". You can only use each effect of \"Bystial Saronir\" once per turn."},"60303245":{"role":"FIRE · Link 1 · ATK 0","quick":"Converts a Normal Summoned 0 ATK Mikanko into a Link body.","caution":"A Special Summoned Hu-Li does not meet its material text. You cannot Normal Summon her on a Lava Golem turn."},"62962630":{"role":"Branded engine","quick":"If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 \"Branded\" Spell/Trap from your Deck to your hand. If a face-up Fusion Monster you control is destroyed by battle, or leaves the field because of an opponent's card effect, while this card is in your GY: You can target 1 Effect Monster your opponent controls; Special Summon this card, and if you do, negate the targeted monster's effects until the end of this turn. You can only use 1 \"Aluber the Jester of Despia\" effect per turn, and only once that turn."},"63013339":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"Requires 2 Effect Monsters and must first be Link Summoned—Raye and Linkage cannot deploy her directly from the Extra Deck. At 3 or fewer Spells, she loads a Sky Striker card from Deck to GY."},"63166095":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"With an empty Main Monster Zone, adds any Sky Striker card except another Engage; if 3 Spells are already in the GY when it resolves, it may also draw 1."},"63288573":{"role":"Sky Striker","quick":"On Special Summon, targets and returns a Sky Striker Spell from the GY."},"63941210":{"role":"LIGHT · Level 10 · ATK 3300","quick":"Tribute one eligible opposing monster; leave 3300 ATK on their field. You may also summon another Kaiju to your own field if they control one.","caution":"Each player can control only one Kaiju. To give them a second, first remove the first. It 